@startuml family-completeness-gate
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #102027
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
left to right direction

title Family-wide binding completeness — omissions become explicit cells

rectangle "Reviewed axes\nprojects · capabilities\nlanguages · unit domains" as AXES #BBDEFB
rectangle "Deterministic generator\nvalidate roots, evidence,\nidentities, and proofs" as GEN #D1C4E9
rectangle "Cartesian inventory\n1 row per\n(project, language, capability)" as MATRIX #FFF9C4
rectangle "Five independent evidence gates\n\n1. idiomatic API + lifecycle\n2. conformance + property + stress\n3. representative native/binding benchmark\n4. API + intended examples + deployment docs\n5. exact registry clean-consumer readback" as EVIDENCE #C8E6C9
rectangle "Strict completion gate\ncomplete, or reviewed\ninapplicability proof" as GATE #C5E1A5
rectangle "Next implementation wave\nordered missing and\naudit-required cells" as WORK #CFD8DC

AXES --> GEN
GEN --> MATRIX
MATRIX --> EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE --> GATE
GATE -[#C62828,dashed]-> WORK : unfinished cells remain visible

note bottom of GATE #E8F5E9
  “Directory exists” is not completion.
  “No row exists” is not inapplicability.
end note

note bottom of WORK #E3F2FD
  Every completed wave adds reviewed
  evidence to the source model and
  regenerates the Cartesian inventory.
end note
@enduml
